libecbor
------------------------------------------
CBOR library with no dependencies, small memory footprint and code size,
developed for both desktop and embedded applications.

Runtime requirements:
  cygwin-3.6.12-1
  libecbor-devel-1.0.3-1bl2
  libecbor1-1.0.3-1bl2
  pkg-config-3.0.11-1

Build requirements:
(besides corresponding -devel packages)
  binutils-2.47-1
  cmake-4.4.5-1
  cygport-0.37.13-1
  gcc-core-14.4.0-1
  libgtest-devel-1.18.0-1bl1
  ninja-1.13.2-1

Canonical website:
  https://github.com/rimio/libecbor

Canonical download:
  https://github.com/rimio/libecbor/archive/refs/tags/v1.0.3.tar.gz

-------------------------------------------

Build instructions:
  1. unpack libecbor-1.0.3-X-src.tar.xz
  2. if you use setup to install this src package,
     it will be unpacked under /usr/src automatically
        % cd /usr/src
        % cygport ./libecbor-1.0.3-X.cygport all

This will create:
  /usr/src/libecbor-1.0.3-X-src.tar.xz
  /usr/src/libecbor-1.0.3-X.tar.xz
  /usr/src/libecbor1-1.0.3-X.tar.xz
  /usr/src/libecbor-devel-1.0.3-X.tar.xz

-------------------------------------------

Files included in the binary package:

(libecbor)
  /usr/bin/ecbor-describe.exe
  /usr/share/doc/Cygwin/libecbor.README
  /usr/share/doc/libecbor/LICENSE
  /usr/share/doc/libecbor/README.md

(libecbor1)
  /usr/bin/cygecbor-1.dll

(libecbor-devel)
  /usr/include/ecbor.h
  /usr/lib/libecbor.dll.a
  /usr/lib/pkgconfig/libecbor.pc

------------------

Port Notes:

